; d_woods: the fight song for zone 1, WOODS. A night jig through the trees, quick and light.
; The hook is a_phase's figure, recovered and played straight (no phasing): the owner found
; its tune catchy, and it is one 12/8 bar, so here it is the jig's tune.
; Key: B minor (a_phase's). 12/8, four dotted-quarter beats a bar.
;   A  Bm  G   Em  A   | Bm  G   Em  F#       the figure on Bm and G, a fourth up on Em, a
;                                              cascade down on A, an arpeggio up on F#
;   B  G   A   Bm  Bm  | G   A   F#sus4 F#    the Catwiz motif, sung over the figure, which
;                                              moves down into the accompaniment
; Tempo: an 8th (a pulse) is 8 ticks; a beat 24 (dotted quarter = 150 bpm); a bar 96 (1.6 s).
; Repeats: A B is 16 bars, 1536 ticks (25.6 s).
; Size: 369 bytes.
;
; Where the motif is:
;   B bars 9 and 11: the motif in B minor, swung to 12/8: B F# E# F# D, then B F# E# F# B,
;     ending high the second time (rhythm 2 4 1 1 4 pulses: da-a DAAAA di da DAAA)
;   B bar 10: its answer in the same rhythm, E C# B C# A (the twitch turned round)
;   B bars 13-14: the motif falling from the top in the same rhythm, D B A# B G and
;     C# A G# A E: the twitch on each chord
;   a_phase's figure (B F# E . D A F# B E . A D): A bars 1 2 5 6, a fourth up in 3 and 7;
;     in B it plays an octave down under the motif (bars 9-14)
;
; Left (chip 1): bass, counter-line, the tune's echo. Right (chip 2): the tune, drums, hats.
; voice 0  bass: dotted quarters, root fifth octave fifth
; voice 1  counter-line: two soft long notes a bar in A; in B the figure, low, then the
;          cadence's notes
; voice 2  the tune's echo, a beat (24 ticks) late and soft (lent to the hero's effects)
; voice 3  the tune: the figure in A, the motif in B; its patterns set no volume, so voice 2
;          shares them
; voice 4  drums: kick on 1 and 3 with the jig's skip before 4, snare on 2 and 4
; voice 5  hats, three to a beat, the first loud (noise; lent to the enemies' effects)
(pattern in_echo "v5 k2 l24 r")
(pattern figs
    "k2 l8 b4 f#5 e5 r d5 a4 f#5 b4 e5 r a5 d5 b4 f#5 e5 r d5 a4 f#5 b4 e5 r a5 d5 e5 b5 a5 r g5 d5 b5 e5 a5 r d6 g5")
(pattern down "e6 c#6 b5 l24 a5 l8 e5 c#5 b4 l24 a4")
(pattern up "l8 f#5 a#5 c#6 l24 f#6 l8 e6 c#6 a#5 l24 c#5")
(pattern t_b
    "k3 l16 b4 l32 f#5 l8 f5 f#5 l32 d5 l16 e5 l32 c#5 l8 b4 c#5 l32 a4 l16 b4 l32 f#5 l8 f5 f#5 l32 b5 l16 a5 l8 b5 l16 a5 l8 f#5 l24 d5 e5 l16 d6 l32 b5 l8 a#5 b5 l32 g5 l16 c#6 l32 a5 l8 g#5 a5 l32 e5 l16 c#6 l8 b5 l16 c#6 l8 e6 l48 c#6 a#5 l24 f#5 c#5")
(pattern bass
    "l24 v12 k3 b1 f#2 b2 f#2 g1 d2 g2 d2 e2 b2 e2 b1 a1 e2 a2 e2 b1 f#2 b2 f#2 g1 d2 g2 d2 e2 b2 e2 b1 f#1 c#2 f#2 c#2 g1 d2 g2 d2 a1 e2 a2 e2 b1 f#2 b2 f#2 b1 f#2 b2 a1 g1 d2 g2 d2 a1 e2 a2 e2 f#1 c#2 b1 c#2 f#1 c#2 a#1 c#2")
(pattern ct_a "l48 v8 k6 d4 f#4 d4 b3 e4 g4 e4 c#4 d4 f#4 d4 b3 g4 e4 c#4 a#3")
(pattern fig_lo "l8 v9 k2 b3 f#4 e4 r d4 a3 f#4 b3 e4 r a4 d4")
(pattern ct_end "l48 v8 k6 c#4 b3 a#3 c#4")
(pattern drums "n7 v12 k1 m1 l24 g1 m2 n5 c4 m1 n7 l16 g1 l8 g1 m2 n5 l24 c4")
(pattern hats "l8 m2 n1 k1 v7 c4 v3 c4 v4 c4")
(voice 0 bass)
(voice 1 ct_a fig_lo fig_lo fig_lo fig_lo fig_lo fig_lo ct_end)
(voice 2 in_echo loop figs down figs up t_b)
(voice 3 figs down figs up t_b)
(voice 4 drums)
(voice 5 hats)
